  "headline": "Polri Postpones Sidang Etik Listyo Sigit Amid Refusal To Attend",
  "seoTitle": "Sidang Etik Listyo Sigit",
  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian National Police postponed the ethics trial for former Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo until November 30 following his refusal to appear.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Police Code of Ethics Commission postponed the trial of former Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo until November 30, 2026.",
    "Officials stated there is no regulation allowing for the forced attendance of the former official at ethics proceedings.",
    "The police clarified that if the former chief remains absent for the rescheduled date, he will forfeit his rights to defense and appeal."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) has officially rescheduled the ethics trial for former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo to November 30, 2026, following his decision not to attend the proceedings originally set for November 26. Police spokespeople confirmed that the former chief has not provided a specific reason for his absence. While investigations regarding alleged wiretapping of the President continue, with six additional suspects identified by the Bareskrim Polri, officials maintained that no special treatment is being granted to the former chief during the ethics investigation. Legal representatives for the police clarified that existing regulations do not permit the force to physically compel an individual to attend an ethics commission hearing. Consequently, the proceedings are scheduled to move forward, and authorities noted that continued failure to appear will result in the loss of the subject's right to present a defense or appeal the final decision.",
